// Retail: Fable.exe (TLC, VC7.1) function @ 0x008BF6A0, length 145 bytes, plain `ret`.
// Callees: CBaseIntelligentPointer::GetPItem @ 0x00A01B50, CVectorMap::LowerBound @ 0x0040F020 (x2),
